                <pb facs="0815" n="801" sameAs="frus:frus1872p2v1/pg801"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Field, Assistant Attorney-General to Mr. Barlow,
                        United States marshal.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <dateline><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                        calendar="gregorian" when="1869-07-01"><hi rendition="#italic">July</hi> 1,
                        1869</date>.</dateline>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">F. C. Barlow</hi>,<lb/><hi
                        rendition="#italic">United States Marshal, New York City:</hi></p>
                <p>Have sent telegrams to marshal and district attorney of Connecticut, to take care
                    of the Fancy and Winona.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. A. FIELD.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
